<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Clarins started at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clarins started at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cosmetics group Clarins was rated &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs as the investment bank started coverage of the stock, Goldman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
